        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "And the priest shall sprinkle the blood upon the altar of the Lord at the door of the tabernacle of the congregation, and burn the fat for a sweet savour unto the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 67,
            "end": 69
